<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Black Lion Why Choose Us Section</title>

  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    body {
      font-family: Inter, Arial, sans-serif;
      background: #111111;
      color: #ffffff;
    }

    .why-section {
      position: relative;
      width: 100%;
      padding: 110px 18px;
      overflow: hidden;
      background:
        linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(8, 8, 8, 0.68) 0%, rgba(8, 8, 8, 0.54) 48%, rgba(8, 8, 8, 0.42) 100%),
        linear-gradient(0deg, rgba(8, 8, 8, 0.62) 0%, rgba(8, 8, 8, 0.30) 100%),
        url("https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1449824913935-59a10b8d2000?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1800&q=85");
      background-size: cover;
      background-position: center;
      color: #ffffff;
    }

    .why-section::before {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      z-index: 1;
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at 78% 18%, rgba(243, 210, 122, 0.16), transparent 34%),
        radial-gradient(circle at 14% 82%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.10), transparent 30%);
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    .why-wrap {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 2;
      width: min(1320px, 100%);
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .why-header {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 0.95fr 0.72fr;
      gap: 90px;
      align-items: end;
      margin-bottom: 58px;
    }

    .why-kicker {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 9px;
      margin-bottom: 22px;
      color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.76);
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .why-kicker::before {
      content: "";
      width: 28px;
      height: 1px;
      background: rgba(243, 210, 122, 0.86);
      display: inline-block;
    }

    .why-title {
      max-width: 760px;
      font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
      font-size: clamp(52px, 5.4vw, 86px);
      line-height: 0.98;
      letter-spacing: -0.065em;
      font-weight: 500;
      color: #ffffff;
    }

    .why-intro {
      max-width: 560px;
      padding-bottom: 8px;
      font-size: 17px;
      line-height: 1.72;
      font-weight: 500;
      color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.76);
    }

    .why-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(12, 1fr);
      gap: 18px;
    }

    .why-card {
      position: relative;
      min-height: 270px;
      padding: 32px;
      border-radius: 26px;
      overflow: hidden;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.14);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.22);
      backdrop-filter: blur(18px);
      -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(18px);
      box-shadow: 0 28px 80px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.22);
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: space-between;
      isolation: isolate;
    }

    .why-card::before {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      z-index: -1;
      background:
        linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12), rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.035)),
        radial-gradient(circle at 100% 0%, rgba(243, 210, 122, 0.18), transparent 38%);
      opacity: 0.9;
      transition: opacity 0.3s ease;
    }

    .why-card:hover::before {
      opacity: 1;
    }

    .why-card.one {
      grid-column: span 6;
    }

    .why-card.two {
      grid-column: span 6;
    }

    .why-card.three,
    .why-card.four,
    .why-card.five {
      grid-column: span 4;
    }

    .why-mark {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      width: fit-content;
      min-width: 54px;
      height: 54px;
      padding: 0 16px;
      margin-bottom: 36px;
      border-radius: 18px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f3d27a 0%, #c99a35 100%);
      color: #111111;
      font-size: 20px;
      line-height: 1;
      font-weight: 900;
      box-shadow: 0 18px 46px rgba(201, 154, 53, 0.26);
    }

    .why-card h3 {
      max-width: 600px;
      font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
      font-size: clamp(34px, 3.4vw, 58px);
      line-height: 1;
      letter-spacing: -0.055em;
      font-weight: 500;
      color: #ffffff;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }

    .why-card.one h3,
    .why-card.two h3 {
      font-size: clamp(42px, 4.6vw, 68px);
      max-width: 760px;
    }

    .why-card p {
      max-width: 640px;
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 1.65;
      font-weight: 500;
      color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.76);
    }

    @media (max-width: 1100px) {
      .why-section {
        padding: 90px 18px;
      }

      .why-header {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        gap: 26px;
        margin-bottom: 46px;
      }

      .why-intro {
        max-width: 760px;
        padding-bottom: 0;
      }

      .why-grid {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      }

      .why-card.one,
      .why-card.two,
      .why-card.three,
      .why-card.four,
      .why-card.five {
        grid-column: auto;
      }

      .why-card.five {
        grid-column: span 2;
      }

      .why-card.one h3,
      .why-card.two h3 {
        font-size: clamp(36px, 5vw, 54px);
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 700px) {
      .why-section {
        padding: 76px 14px;
        background-position: center;
      }

      .why-kicker {
        margin-bottom: 18px;
      }

      .why-title {
        font-size: clamp(42px, 12vw, 60px);
        line-height: 1;
        letter-spacing: -0.06em;
      }

      .why-intro {
        font-size: 15.5px;
        line-height: 1.7;
      }

      .why-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        gap: 14px;
      }

      .why-card,
      .why-card.five {
        grid-column: auto;
        min-height: auto;
        padding: 24px;
        border-radius: 22px;
      }

      .why-mark {
        height: 48px;
        min-width: 48px;
        padding: 0 14px;
        border-radius: 16px;
        margin-bottom: 30px;
        font-size: 18px;
      }

      .why-card h3,
      .why-card.one h3,
      .why-card.two h3 {
        font-size: clamp(34px, 10vw, 46px);
        letter-spacing: -0.055em;
      }

      .why-card p {
        font-size: 14.5px;
        line-height: 1.62;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <section class="why-section" id="why-choose-us">
    <div class="why-wrap">

      <div class="why-header">
        <div>
          <div class="why-kicker">Why Choose Us</div>

          <h2 class="why-title">Built to Earn Your Trust</h2>
        </div>

        <p class="why-intro">
          Work with a remodeling and construction team based in Newark, Delaware, serving homeowners and businesses with experience, proper coverage, clear communication, and dependable workmanship.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="why-grid">

        <div class="why-card one">
          <div>
            <div class="why-mark">10+</div>
            <h3>10+ Years in Business</h3>
          </div>

          <p>
            A proven construction and remodeling company with hands-on experience across residential and commercial projects.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="why-card two">
          <div>
            <div class="why-mark">✓</div>
            <h3>Licensed & Insured</h3>
          </div>

          <p>
            Work with a professional team that follows proper standards, protects your property, and takes project responsibility seriously.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="why-card three">
          <div>
            <div class="why-mark">★</div>
            <h3>Veteran Owned</h3>
          </div>

          <p>
            A company built on discipline, accountability, service, and pride in doing the work the right way.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="why-card four">
          <div>
            <div class="why-mark">A+</div>
            <h3>A+ BBB Rating</h3>
          </div>

          <p>
            A strong reputation signal that reflects professionalism, trust, and commitment to client satisfaction.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="why-card five">
          <div>
            <div class="why-mark">↔</div>
            <h3>Clear Communication. Quality Builds.</h3>
          </div>

          <p>
            Get honest expectations, direct updates, durable materials, clean workmanship, and construction details built for long-term value.
          </p>
        </div>

      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

</body>
</html>
